# LiteSpeed & Reverse Proxy: Disable buffering for instant real-time Server-Sent Events (SSE)
<IfModule Litespeed>
  RewriteEngine On
  RewriteRule .* - [E=nobs:1]
</IfModule>

<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  Header set Cache-Control "no-cache, no-transform, no-buffer"
  Header set X-Accel-Buffering "no"
  Header set X-LiteSpeed-Buffer "no"
</IfModule>
